  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/781175650865517510-OeznZc.png\" alt=\"未定义\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/thBV2Mq\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/223938153260515328.svg?color=7289DA&label=discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 服务器\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweblate.moddinglegacy.com%252fprojects%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/translate-weblate-2ECCAA?style=for-the-badge&logo=weblate&logoColor=white\" alt=\"通过 Weblate 翻译为《熔岩怪物》贡献力量，打破语言障碍！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"如果你喜欢我们的工作，请考虑在 Ko-fi 上支持我们！谢谢！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/BUILT_WITH-NEOFORGE-d7742f?style=for-the-badge&logo=neoforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"基于 NeoForge 构建\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/ModdingLegacy?style=social\" alt=\"关注我们！ModdingLegacy Twitter\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fModdingLegacy.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ModdingLegacy.com-0285FF?logo=bluesky&logoColor=00&style=social\" alt=\"关注我们！ModdingLegacy.com Bluesky\"> </a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/channel/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ?sub_confirmation=1&style=social&label=@ModdingLegacy\" alt=\"在 YouTube 上订阅我们！\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-style:italic;text-align:center;font-weight:600\">添加了在熔岩中生成的怪物。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">📚 描述</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">如果你曾经因为挖到熔岩层后敌对生物停止生成而感到无聊，那么这个模组就是为你准备的！这是一个小型模组，为游戏添加了新的敌对怪物——熔岩怪物，它们会在熔岩中生成并向你发射火球。熔岩怪物的生成条件可以在一个方便易用的属性文件中进行调整！</p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">模组展示</h3>\n<p><span><span><iframe class=\"spoiler\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cEgOo5aep9Q\" width=\"1000\" height=\"515\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🤷 常见问题 (FAQ)</h2>\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">我可以在自己的整合包中使用这个模组吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">当然可以。只需分别注明所有作者的贡献，并链接回 CurseForge 页面即可。</p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">我可以将这个模组重新分发到其他平台吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">可以，但在操作前请确保所有下载链接都直接指向 CurseForge，并分别注明所有作者的贡献。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🌐 翻译《熔岩怪物》- 帮助打破语言障碍！</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">所有译者的贡献均已在此列出。感谢每一位帮助让本模组更易于访问的译者！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/southafrica.png\" alt=\"南非荷兰语（Suid-Afrika）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>南非荷兰语（Suid-Afrika）翻译：Wendigo44</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/saudiarabia.png\" alt=\"阿拉伯语（العربية）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>阿拉伯语（العربية）翻译：VXsz, fl.bnmbnm</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"加泰罗尼亚语（Catalunya）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>加泰罗尼亚语（Catalunya）翻译：Minaderm</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/czechrepublic.png\" alt=\"捷克语（Česko）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>捷克语（Česko）翻译：frantisekbenes65</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/unitedkingdom.png\" alt=\"威尔士语（Cymru）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>威尔士语（Cymru）翻译：Fl3x_X_Placid, </strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/germany.png\" alt=\"德语旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>德语翻译：xTomFox, m.strongamov</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/argentina.png\" alt=\"西班牙语（Argentina）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙语（Argentina）翻译：tomasaisama2008</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/chile.png\" alt=\"西班牙语（Chile）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙语（Chile）翻译：Vantanase</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"西班牙语（España）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙语（España）翻译：josebaizairiondo, Minaderm</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/mexico.png\" alt=\"西班牙语（México）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙语（México）翻译：Vamacheron</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/iran.png\" alt=\"波斯语（Fārsiy）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>波斯语（Fārsiy）翻译：khbatwyy63</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/canada.png\" alt=\"法语（Québec）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>法语（Québec）翻译：Lachney</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/france.png\" alt=\"法语（France）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>法语（France）翻译：Lachney</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"加利西亚语（Galicia）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>加利西亚语（Galicia）翻译：Minaderm</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/israel.png\" alt=\"希伯来语（'Ivriyþ）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>希伯来语（'Ivriyþ）翻译：Ido</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/hungary.png\" alt=\"匈牙利语（Magyarország）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>匈牙利语（Magyarország）翻译：wrghig</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/indonesia.png\" alt=\"印尼语（Indonesia）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>印尼语（Indonesia）翻译：accountforcommenting23</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/italy.png\" alt=\"意大利语（Italia）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>意大利语（Italia）翻译：Giorgiovanni</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/japan.png\" alt=\"日语（Nihongo）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>日语（Nihongo）翻译：Vamacheron, お馬</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/southkorea.png\" alt=\"韩语（Hangugeo）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>韩语（Hangugeo）翻译：LoboAzul0103</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/lithuania.png\" alt=\"立陶宛语旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>立陶宛语翻译：WaryRGMCA</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/malaysia.png\" alt=\"马来语（Malaysia）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>马来语（Malaysia）翻译：StearING2</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/belgium.png\" alt=\"佛兰芒语（Vlaanderen）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>佛兰芒语（Vlaanderen）翻译：Jelle</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/netherlands.png\" alt=\"荷兰语（Nederland）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>荷兰语（Nederland）翻译：Sindarin27, Jelle</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/poland.png\" alt=\"波兰语（Polska）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>波兰语（Polska）翻译：Matzetix</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/brazil.png\" alt=\"葡萄牙语（Brasil）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>葡萄牙语（Brasil）翻译：cesarlopesg354035, Mikeliro</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/russia.png\" alt=\"俄语（Russkiy）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>俄语（Russkiy）翻译：PinkGoose</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/sweden.png\" alt=\"瑞典语（Sverige）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>瑞典语（Sverige）翻译：1019milo</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/turkey.png\" alt=\"土耳其语（Türkiye）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>土耳其语（Türkiye）翻译：CreepSkeet</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/china.png\" alt=\"简体中文（中国大陆）旗帜\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>简体中文（中国大陆）翻译：S0ar1ngDeath, likefishlike</strong> </span> </p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"color:#f00;font-size:2.5em\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-size:1.1em;line-height:1em\"><strong>🤚 支持：如果您对我们的模组有任何疑问或问题，请阅读常见问题解答！您也可以<a style=\"display:inline;color:#f00;font-size:1.3em;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fgroups%252fmodding-legacy%252f-%252fissues\" rel=\"nofollow\">在问题跟踪器上提交反馈</a>，或加入我们的 Discord 服务器，我们将为您提供帮助！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/thBV2Mq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 服务器\"></a></p>",
